atest?cb=20200630195208&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bag_You_Desire_95b084.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a bag you desire.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.50 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It contains the most powerful artifacts from the depths of Zarganash's darkest realms.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>For non-boss creatures, this item is only dropped by players with at least one of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Goshnar%27s%20Taints\">Goshnar's Taints</a> active. For non-boss creatures and bosses with the exception of <a href=\"#/wiki/Goshnar%27s%20Megalomania\">Goshnar's Megalomania</a>, the drop chance is higher for players with more taints. The chance of dropping it from Megalomania increases every time you kill it and resets to the initial value whenever a Bag is dropped. \n</p><p>While you can not equip these bags, they are an exception in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclopedia\">Bosstiary</a>'s equipment loot bonus, and setting Soul War bosses in your boss slot will increase the chances of dropping it.\n</p><p>The bag quickly transforms into another item once the Reward Container it's in is opened. It can be transformed into any of the parts of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Soul%20Set\">Soul Set</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Soulbastion\"><img alt=\"Soulbastion\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Soulbastion_eb5627.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Soulbastion\">Soulbastion</a> - Knights</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Soulcrusher\"><img alt=\"Soulcrusher\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Soulcrusher_eb40f1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Soulcrusher\">Soulcrusher</a> - Knights</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Soulmaimer\"><img alt=\"Soulmaimer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Soulmaimer_a212c2.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Soulmaimer\">Soulmaimer</a> - Knights</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Soulcutter\"><img alt=\"Soulcutter\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Soulcutter_68daca.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Soulcutter\">Soulcutter</a> - Knights</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Soulshredder\"><img alt=\"Soulshredder\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Soulshredder_e0faf7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Soulshredder\">Soulshredder</a> - Knights</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Soulbiter\"><img alt=\"Soulbiter\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Soulbiter_fd317e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Soulbiter\">Soulbiter</a> - Knights</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Souleater%20%28Axe%29\"><img alt=\"Souleater (Axe)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Souleater_Axe_17c5ed.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Souleater%20%28Axe%29\">Souleater</a> - Knights</li>\n